window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>He’s the Bane of my existence.</b></p> <p>My fated mate.</p> <p>The timing is all wrong, but fate doesn't wait for anyone.</p> <p>I’m searching for my missing brother, but Bane finds me first.</p> <p>He doesn’t give me a choice: I’m his, and now, so is my mission.</p> <p>When our worlds collide, our past changes our future.</p> <p>He's the exiled Demon Prince.</p> <p>And for me, he will become the king.</p> <p><i>Note: This is book four in the Fated Love Series. While it can be listened to as a standalone, it's suggested to listen to previous installments in order.</i></p> <p><i>Book One: Forewarned</i></p> <p><i>Book Two: Foretold</i></p> <p><i>Book Three: Masked Fate</i></p>"; 
